{
    "title": "Drawing Desk: Draw, Paint Art",
    "description": "Trusted by over 50 million users worldwide with over 100000+ 5 star reviews,  Drawing Desk is the #1 app for learning and practicing drawing & painting skills.\r\n\r\nNow you can draw, doodle, sketch, paint or color with the Drawing Desk app on your phone or pad. Our unique collection of pro tools such as pencils, crayons, watercolor brushes and much more will help anyone to create amazing art works. Drawing Desk app is one of the best apps to learn and draw art or illustrations.\r\n\r\nLearn How to Draw with Brand-new Marvel Super Hero Drawing Lessons!\r\n\r\n- Collection of 50+ Marvel Super Hero lessons making it easier for everyone to draw their favorite Super Heroes!\r\n- Featuring all of Marvel\u2019s iconic Super Heroes including Spider-Man, Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, Black Panther, and so many more\r\n- Learn how to draw these Super Heroes in multiple poses with clear on-screen instructions, user-friendly canvas guides, and intuitive options\r\n- More Marvel step-by-step lessons to be released monthly\r\n-Enjoy additional 270+ lessons across a range of topics including drawing cartoons, Anime & Manga art, adorable Chibi characters and more, all thoughtfully crafted by professional artists\r\n-Try your first Marvel Lesson today!\r\n\r\nBest app to draw, sketch ,paint and to practice drawing skills\r\n-25+ sketch tools including pen, pencil, crayon, neon, watercolor brush, ink, smudge, eraser, fill bucket\r\n- Draw & paint in various Canvas sizes (Pad app only) \r\n-Unlimited layers\r\n- Draw Quick Shapes\r\n- Draw your art using a symmetry tool.\r\n-200+ instant shapes to draw & paint\r\n-Color palettes & gradients for painting\r\n-Fill bucket drawing tool with 125+ textures \r\n- Auto Colorize - Color your sketch or drawing in 10 seconds. (Powered by AI)\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD DRAWING DESK GAME!\r\n\r\nDrawing Desk game is for anyone who likes drawing, painting, designing, and learning digital art. The Drawing Desk game has been developed to make sketching, painting, designing, and learning digital art enjoyable.\r\n\r\nDrawing Desk is an app that caters to the creative spirit in everyone. It is truly the best app to draw, paint & scribble, and create pro digital illustrations and art",
    "descriptionHTML": "Trusted by over 50 million users worldwide with over 100000+ 5 star reviews,  Drawing Desk is the #1 app for learning and practicing drawing &amp; painting skills.<br><br>Now you can draw, doodle, sketch, paint or color with the Drawing Desk app on your phone or pad. Our unique collection of pro tools such as pencils, crayons, watercolor brushes and much more will help anyone to create amazing art works. Drawing Desk app is one of the best apps to learn and draw art or illustrations.<br><br>Learn How to Draw with Brand-new Marvel Super Hero Drawing Lessons!<br><br>- Collection of 50+ Marvel Super Hero lessons making it easier for everyone to draw their favorite Super Heroes!<br>- Featuring all of Marvel\u2019s iconic Super Heroes including Spider-Man, Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, Black Panther, and so many more<br>- Learn how to draw these Super Heroes in multiple poses with clear on-screen instructions, user-friendly canvas guides, and intuitive options<br>- More Marvel step-by-step lessons to be released monthly<br>-Enjoy additional 270+ lessons across a range of topics including drawing cartoons, Anime &amp; Manga art, adorable Chibi characters and more, all thoughtfully crafted by professional artists<br>-Try your first Marvel Lesson today!<br><br>Best app to draw, sketch ,paint and to practice drawing skills<br>-25+ sketch tools including pen, pencil, crayon, neon, watercolor brush, ink, smudge, eraser, fill bucket<br>- Draw &amp; paint in various Canvas sizes (Pad app only) <br>-Unlimited layers<br>- Draw Quick Shapes<br>- Draw your art using a symmetry tool.<br>-200+ instant shapes to draw &amp; paint<br>-Color palettes &amp; gradients for painting<br>-Fill bucket drawing tool with 125+ textures <br>- Auto Colorize - Color your sketch or drawing in 10 seconds. (Powered by AI)<br><br>DOWNLOAD DRAWING DESK GAME!<br><br>Drawing Desk game is for anyone who likes drawing, painting, designing, and learning digital art. The Drawing Desk game has been developed to make sketching, painting, designing, and learning digital art enjoyable.<br><br>Drawing Desk is an app that caters to the creative spirit in everyone. It is truly the best app to draw, paint &amp; scribble, and create pro digital illustrations and art",
